# Configure Production Environment for {{ stack_name }}

Runbook for onboarding `{{ stack_name }}` into `homelab-ops` Ansible automation.

## 1. Register Stack in Workload Inventory

In `homelab-ops/group_vars/all/workloads/compose_stacks.yml`:

```yaml
compose_stacks:
  {{ stack_name }}:
    repo_url: "https://github.com/{{ image_registry_namespace | replace('ghcr.io/', '') }}/{{ stack_name }}.git"
    version: "v1.0.0"
    target_hosts: ["prd-worker-01.lan"]
    environment_variables:
      SERVICE_HTTP_PORT: {{ service_http_port }}
      DATA_DIR: "/opt/homelab/prod/data/{{ stack_name }}"
```

## 2. Converge Fleet Node

```bash
ansible-playbook -i inventory.ini playbooks/deploy_stack.yml -e "stack={{ stack_name }}"
```
